	abstract = {The uncertainty of renewable energy generating unit output threatens the safe operation of the power system. As one of the main ways to consume renewable energy, the energy scheduling method of park-level integrated energy system has been a hot research area. In this study, a multi-objective optimal scheduling model of the park-level integrated energy system with the goal of optimal satisfaction is established, and the three indicators of operating cost, carbon emission, and energy utilization are considered comprehensively, and the multi-seasonal load scenarios and time-of-day tariffs are introduced, so as to model and solve the energy scheduling scheme of the energy system, and the actual case of {GAMS} software proves that the scheduling strategy can improve the economy of energy scheduling. © 2024 {SPIE}.},
